<description>&lt;p&gt;Iraqi authorities condemned the deadly attack on a Greek Orthodox church in Jordan and arrested suspects, while Iraqi leaders blamed external agents for the incident. Iranian forces were accused of severe border violations and smuggling, and the Iraqi border with Saudi Arabia was declared fully secured. Pro-Iran factions in Iraq alleged US airspace violations amid a disarmament dispute, and US travel warnings against Iraq remain in effect. The prime minister pledged to place armed factions and weapons under state control by June 2027. 396 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiekFVX3lxTE9OeTc1VE5lcEx0QzNhVlh6TnBVZUhfdi1MR0xZQnJOLWo2U3dHb09ucVhPNXctSTFXNTF6R3EwZEJXSl96SF9zS2FPUWFwcHpHeFVMaGtUckZiaGIydHc1SFMwT3U1R1h5WnMtY2RGUkdtYm1jV2VUMWFB?oc=5&quot;&gt;Radio Free Europe/Radio Liberty&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;وكالة الانباء العراقية (واع)&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXEFVX3lxTFBRc0Z5Sm9GTGp5LXVvaGxUNVE4V2Q3LTY5M3o0U05ab2xGQnVzTE5aZ3NJVHpPdXFWRGRiRWpTZDdKc0ZaQnZWN2JCcHpMZk96cTR2UzQ4T3dDcFU2?oc=5&quot;&gt;The Jerusalem Post&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiswFBVV95cUxPQkhSaHFWS0otMGs0bUpRMkl2RnRndWlEMS00WFR5aU81cnJITHF4Z05XRHdwV1MyTUU0ckFoc2k4Ty01R3ZIUFFTLXZNY2NlMkVVdzlZQTNVQ2oyRUdRWXBQZUQ2THVYd0FLS24wVTJQUGJQLWZZQWJnQnljZGpBYy0yOHd6ZmhGalg0QlR2RVJCSDNhOXdldDlBcGVzY0ViM0hJM3FHSW50WndudGlLMVdqQQ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiXkFVX3lxTE5JTFJqUXUzQllvRGZfTC1IYUJXaWhOdGlkRE5WdXhXN2ZOV19vcGt3bmVxbk5TSjlXWUNpVnh4WHV2M1FhWGFXbHRNRGwwbmozMnVoYnJLclNidHFoakE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Rudaw&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMilgFBVV95cUxNV